	(text "VSEL strapped low: 1.025V reset value; I2C address 0x1C.\nRK809 EXT_EN controls startup. Retain DVS via fan53555 driver.\nFive local bypass capacitors follow NanoPi R3S power sheet.\nRoute FB separately to processor load; CPU worst-case load and current revision require closure."
